 &gt;linux_pinctrl相关介绍&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://developer.toradex.com/linux-bsp/how-to/device-tree/device-tree-customization/#imx-6-based-modules" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;Device_Tree_Doc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>